      "writtenOn": "2021-01-11T14:11:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I tested it and there is no difference in EC logs and behaviour, so configuring port as CAP_DEDICATED in pe_snk_hard_reset_entry() is not necessary. Removed code responsible for this.",
      "parentUuid": "ac4b65a7_983b621b",
