      "writtenOn": "2021-01-07T22:31:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see what you mean.  It seems like there\u0027s work needed to get pd_send_hard_reset() working correctly (ideally, it should work from any PE state and send a hard reset, similar to TCPMv1).\n\nI think I\u0027d prefer to make pd_send_hard_reset() work correctly since it\u0027s also being used in other code paths (ex. OCP), though enabling and disabling PD also makes sense.  Would the re-enable kick off the PE states again?  I didn\u0027t see from a cursory look where it might be doing that.",
      "parentUuid": "2378c645_3bca0e45",
      "revId": "0154fcaf2b272e6ebec58cae561a74505ed99ddc",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
