      "writtenOn": "2021-01-08T09:54:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When we call tc_policy_pd_enable(port, 0) it will set PD_DISABLED_BY_POLICY flag.\npd_task_loop() in next iteration will call pe_run() with enable set to 0 (because tc_get_pd_enabled() will return that). Calling pe_run() will set state to NULL and set local_state to SM_PAUSED. When PD_DISABLED_BY_POLICY flag is cleared, pe_run() will perform initialization and we will start from PE_SNK_Startup state.\n\nNevertheless, I will try to fix pd_send_hard_reset() and use it.",
      "parentUuid": "274197ab_9e5f4ef2",
      "revId": "0154fcaf2b272e6ebec58cae561a74505ed99ddc",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
